[h1]More Tenets Slots (XA) — CK3 1.20.0.3[/h1]
Expand your rite's core tenet slots to 100, with scrollable grids in the new rite creation and faith interfaces.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Up to 100 core tenet slots for rites, using the game's current tenet definitions.
[*]Scrollable tenet grids in rite creation and both faith detail layouts. The final slot's selector opens normally.
[*]Create and save a rite with two real core tenets and leave the remaining trailing slots empty. Add tenets in order: gaps between selected tenets are rejected by the game.
[*]Culture tradition base limit remains 10000; normal eligibility, costs and cooldowns apply.
[/list]
Native tenet restrictions, conflicts, DLC requirements and costs still apply. A 100-slot limit does not guarantee 100 mutually compatible tenets.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Version 10 is tested on [b]CK3 1.20.0.3 (Crozier)[/b], including English creation/save and Simplified Chinese cold reload with two real tenets. Tests cover the recorded installation and DLC combination; they do not cover every combination or 10000 traditions. Migration of CK3 1.19 saves is unverified. The separate POD patches are not covered by this release. Mods replacing the same faith or rite windows may need a compatibility patch.

[h2]中文说明[/h2]
为新版礼仪系统扩展至 [b]100 个核心信条槽位[/b]，创建窗口与信仰详情窗口均可滚动查看。
[list]
[*]使用新版游戏原生信条定义，保留原生费用、互斥、条件及 DLC 限制。
[*]可以只选两个真实信条，尾部其余槽位留空，并正常创建、保存及冷重载。请顺序添加信条；已选信条之间的空洞仍会被游戏拒绝。
[*]已修复末端槽位打开选择器时的崩溃，第 100 槽可正常打开。
[*]文化传统基础上限保持 10000，原生费用、条件和冷却仍生效。
[/list]
版本 10 已在 CK3 1.20.0.3 验证代表性关键流程，未穷举全部信条、DLC 组合或 10000 项传统；100 个槽位也不代表有 100 个互不冲突的信条。1.19 旧存档跨版本迁移未验证；本次更新不包含独立 POD 补丁。同样覆盖信仰或礼仪窗口的其他 mod 可能需要兼容补丁。

